Upstream identifiers that remain in the codebase
------------------------------------------------

The following names are functional upstream surface, not RAN branding. They are
intentionally unchanged so the port stays buildable and can sync with upstream:

  - npm packages:        @openhands/agent-canvas, @openhands/typescript-client,
                         @openhands/extensions
  - container images:    ghcr.io/openhands/agent-canvas
  - on-disk state:       .openhands directories, ~/.openhands
  - container paths:     /home/openhands/.openhands
  - environment vars:    OH_* (for example OH_SESSION_API_KEYS_0,
                         OH_CANVAS_SAFE_STATE_DIR)
  - upstream services:   docs.openhands.dev, go.openhands.dev
  - the `agent-canvas` CLI/binary name

